    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"2\">Level 2 - Beginner</span><span class=\"time\">15 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">BST</span><span class=\"chip accent\">LCA</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/lowest-common-ancestor-of-a-binary-search-tree/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 235</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Lowest Common Ancestor of a Binary Search Tree</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">In a BST the values tell you where p and q live. Walk down from the root: if both are smaller go left, if both are larger go right, otherwise this node is where their paths split, and that is the answer. O(h) time, O(1) space, no recursion needed.</p>\n"
